{"src":"en","tgt":"fr","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":163400,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"fr","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":5808.020873,"text":"Lions are the most social cats living in large groups called prides."},{"kind":"text","t":6117.091777000001,"text":"Les lions sont les félins les plus sociaux, vivant en grands groupes appelés troupes."},{"kind":"audio","t":6170.223134,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6171.742278000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6173.079137000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":6173.305498000001,"samples":11496,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":140},{"kind":"input","t":11408.918329,"text":"In the warm climate of the Middle East, the house was not so important."},{"kind":"text","t":11730.824487,"text":"Dans le climat chaud du Moyen-Orient, la maison n'était pas si importante."},{"kind":"audio","t":11782.016529,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11783.536583000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11785.422468,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":11785.588758,"samples":11496,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":120},{"kind":"input","t":17714.117438,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":18188.729106,"text":"Ce sont presque toutes des plages de sable avec une baignade sécurisée et la plupart disposent d'un ombrage assuré par"},{"kind":"audio","t":18247.001651,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":18248.601817,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18250.384456,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18252.074767000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18253.89295,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18254.560684,"samples":18560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"input","t":20568.963543,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":20685.761525,"text":"des arbres pohican."},{"kind":"audio","t":20734.722162000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20735.001042,"samples":11032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":90},{"kind":"input","t":26108.539587,"text":"Brides are made up of one of two three related adult males along with us"},{"kind":"text","t":26476.931625,"text":"Les groupes nuptiaux sont composés de un, deux ou trois mâles adultes apparentés ainsi que de nous."},{"kind":"audio","t":26531.501155,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26533.026828000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":26534.746193,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26536.599208,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":26536.776434,"samples":8728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":32624.721837999998,"text":"Feral children may have experienced severe child abuse or trauma before being abandoned or running away."},{"kind":"text","t":33138.33995,"text":"Les enfants sauvages peuvent avoir subi des maltraitances graves ou des traumatismes avant d'être abandonnés ou de s'enfuir."},{"kind":"audio","t":33195.678482,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33197.164616,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33198.907115,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33200.682884,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33202.453716,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33203.224565,"samples":17960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"input","t":38515.311185,"text":"Scottport Bus 403 traverse regularly to Centra stopping at Cabo de Roca."},{"kind":"text","t":38887.81277,"text":"Le bus 403 de Scottport dessert régulièrement Centra avec un arrêt à Cabo de Roca."},{"kind":"audio","t":38943.89302,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38945.34955,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38947.091919,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":38948.860798,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38949.32804,"samples":16528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":290},{"kind":"input","t":45844.298647,"text":"To get the best views of Hong Kong, leave the island and head for the Kowloon waterfront opposite."},{"kind":"text","t":46387.512228,"text":"Pour profiter des meilleures vues de Hong Kong, quittez l'île et dirigez-vous vers le front de mer de Kowloon, juste en face."},{"kind":"audio","t":46443.419908,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46445.048717,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":46446.778196,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46448.611011,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46450.408203,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46450.554903000004,"samples":8960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":51204.539652,"text":"Accepted were Aristotle's views on all matters of science, including physiology."},{"kind":"text","t":51608.403131,"text":"Les points de vue d'Aristote étaient acceptés sur toutes les questions scientifiques, y compris la physiologie."},{"kind":"audio","t":51663.380794,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51665.099086,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51666.860464,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51668.665638,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51669.568745,"samples":23128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":580},{"kind":"input","t":61133.652453,"text":"Australia's Mitchell Gowrie finished 11th in the men's standing Super G Chet's competitor."},{"kind":"text","t":61552.752305,"text":"L'Australien Mitchell Gowrie a terminé 11e du Super G debout masculin, le concurrent de Chet."},{"kind":"audio","t":61608.848039,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61610.323867,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61612.107268,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61613.877759,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61614.167014,"samples":12328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":100},{"kind":"input","t":67017.47446700001,"text":"Ulrich Joklin finished 16th in the men's sitting Super G."},{"kind":"text","t":67310.267284,"text":"Ulrich Joklin a terminé 16e du Super G assis masculin."},{"kind":"audio","t":67362.104566,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67363.67653900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67365.468883,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":67365.575684,"samples":6096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":73763.378576,"text":"The city is in stark contrast to the rest of the country's cities because it is more of an Arabic flair than of an Arabic flair."},{"kind":"text","t":74167.329967,"text":"La ville contraste fortement avec les autres villes du pays car elle a davantage un style arabe qu'un style arabe."},{"kind":"audio","t":74223.65296200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74225.16168,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74226.86437,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74228.637535,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74230.412824,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":74230.526635,"samples":4160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":84740.267908,"text":"Also, after revolution, occupants were open to all male applicants, allowing the most ambitious and successful to succeed."},{"kind":"text","t":85287.63964,"text":"De plus, après la révolution, les postes étaient ouverts à tous les candidats masculins, permettant aux plus ambitieux et aux plus performants de réussir."},{"kind":"audio","t":85345.196439,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85346.777887,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85348.544442,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85350.315955,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85352.16861,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":85353.965371,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85354.552904,"samples":18192,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"input","t":91844.04229,"text":"The fission bomb works on the principle that it takes energy to put together a nucleus with many protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"text","t":92310.538569,"text":"La bombe à fission repose sur le principe qu'il faut de l'énergie pour assembler un noyau comprenant de nombreux protons et neutrons."},{"kind":"audio","t":92367.534205,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92369.120449,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92370.934566,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92372.751007,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92374.577843,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92375.611146,"samples":25160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":97428.802713,"text":"He did not set a figure for the cuts, saying they will be made based on China's economic output."},{"kind":"text","t":97928.312779,"text":"Il n'a pas fixé de montant pour les coupes, déclarant qu'elles seront effectuées en fonction de la production économique de la Chine."},{"kind":"audio","t":97985.327864,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97986.881249,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":97988.747605,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97990.640099,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97992.420656,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97993.135791,"samples":19760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"input","t":105748.212182,"text":"There is no universal definition for which manufactured items are antiques. Some tax agencies define goods older than 100 years."},{"kind":"text","t":106109.751289,"text":"Il n'existe pas de définition universelle pour déterminer quels articles manufacturés sont des antiquités. Certaines administrations fiscales définissent les biens de plus de 100 ans."},{"kind":"audio","t":106155.239076,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106156.810168,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106158.593378,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":106160.398932,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106162.177826,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":106162.301232,"samples":8960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":106193.544467,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106195.150792,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106196.913802,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106197.358951,"samples":15696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"input","t":113914.659427,"text":"In the archipelago and lakes you do not necessarily need a yacht"},{"kind":"text","t":114289.838978,"text":"Dans l'archipel et les lacs, vous n'avez pas nécessairement besoin d'un yacht."},{"kind":"audio","t":114342.518977,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114344.03115,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114345.795212,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":114346.205719,"samples":10896,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":100},{"kind":"input","t":123554.406142,"text":"The aspect ratio of this format, dividing by 12 to obtain the simplest whole number ratio, is therefore said to be 3 to 2."},{"kind":"text","t":124210.931774,"text":"Le rapport d'aspect de ce format, en divisant par 12 pour obtenir le rapport d'entiers le plus simple, est donc dit être de 3 pour 2."},{"kind":"audio","t":124269.015425,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":124270.585876,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124272.306412,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":124274.049402,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124275.807785,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124277.569864,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":124277.683625,"samples":3192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":131827.136843,"text":"It's renowned for being an epicenter of luxury began in about 400 AD and lasted up a"},{"kind":"text","t":132435.83050299998,"text":"Il est réputé pour être un épicentre du luxe qui a débuté vers 400 apr. J.-C. et a duré jusqu'à"},{"kind":"audio","t":132489.776655,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132491.54268999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132493.29814899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132494.33538799998,"samples":24696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":660},{"kind":"audio","t":132520.80913299997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132521.369155,"samples":20632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"input","t":136073.788816,"text":"until about 1100 AD."},{"kind":"text","t":136307.702907,"text":"environ 1100 apr. J.-C."},{"kind":"audio","t":136357.489576,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136357.72209599998,"samples":14632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":260},{"kind":"audio","t":136390.51416899997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":136390.697975,"samples":832,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":145354.19048199998,"text":"Cancellation policies vary but as of late March most coronavirus based cancellation policies don't extend to July 2020 when the Olympics"},{"kind":"text","t":146068.255798,"text":"Les politiques d'annulation varient, mais fin mars, la plupart des politiques d'annulation liées au coronavirus ne s'étendent pas jusqu'en juillet 2020, date à laquelle les Jeux olympiques"},{"kind":"audio","t":146130.46322799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146132.097285,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146133.851882,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146135.64713099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146137.50784799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146139.27221999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146140.950643,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146142.438249,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":146142.53196,"samples":656,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":154624.898035,"text":"Swirl the two dry powers together and then with clean wet hands squeeze them into a ball"},{"kind":"text","t":155141.555597,"text":"Mélangez les deux poudres sèches, puis, avec des mains propres et humides, pressez-les pour former une boule."},{"kind":"audio","t":155196.237696,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155197.879934,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155199.73511299997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":155201.50587499997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155201.95838499998,"samples":15328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"input","t":162227.02249899998,"text":"St. Petersburg cruises include time in town. Cruise passengers are exempted from visa requirements."},{"kind":"text","t":162561.59369699997,"text":"Les croisières à Saint-Pétersbourg incluent du temps en ville. Les passagers de croisière sont exemptés des exigences de visa."},{"kind":"audio","t":162613.726914,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162615.475823,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162616.32892499998,"samples":22664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"audio","t":162651.252613,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162652.902553,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162654.639825,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":162654.785403,"samples":9096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":173502.76710199998,"code":1005}]}